_:b5df4347ddf6c50866be24ab96214b21 rdf:first stsh:ShapeReferenceShape .
stsh:ShapeOrListOfShapesShape rdfs:comment "SHACLRule.get_conditions() accepts sh:condition as either a single shape reference or a SHACL list whose members are each shape references. Uses the same stsh:ShapeReferenceShape as sh:someValue/sh:memberShape/sh:reifierShape - sh:condition is now in starshacl/native_components.py's SHAPE_EXPECTING_PREDICATES too, so starShacl auto-types its value(s) the same way as those three before pySHACL ever runs, whether or not the user's own shapes graph already had explicit sh:NodeShape/sh:PropertyShape typing. One consistent fix strategy for all four, not a stricter one-off for sh:condition."@en ;
